ind":"update","title":"Demo update preparing for Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hello, The Demo today received a huge update, both major and minor things are completely changed, a lot of content has either been added or reworked. This demo version is very close to what you can expect from the beginning of the final version of the game. Big Demo Changes:Enemies now walk on 3 lanes instead of 1.The Snow map is now playable.Origins: Item may have synergies between them, if you equip more items with the same origin you gain bonuses based on the origin.Way more meta upgrades in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T19:27:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951301096","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4492500-1830163047267379","game_id":"steam-4492500","kind":"update","title":"Demo first patch","summary":"The Demo has been out for a couple days now, and i noticed a couple things that needed to be fixed, so here's a patch, it's already out now. This time balance changes are aimed at making the early game stages easier, especially when you are unlucky. Balance Changes:Your first Attack is now consistently fast if you haven't attacked in a while (this is a buff to slow weapons)Ranged enemies base damage 6 -> 4Tank enemies armor scaling halved You can't drop the same item slot twice in a rowYou can't","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-20T23:57:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047267379","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4492500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:23Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_